# Git must not rewrite anything in this repository.
#
# The source files are CRLF with a byte order mark, and they are compared with a diff tool
# that is set up for exactly that. Line ending conversion on checkout or commit would show
# every file as changed on somebody else's machine, and .res, .dcr, .ico, .bmp and .cur are
# binary besides.
#
# -text on everything switches the conversion off, both directions, for every file.

* -text
